  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u7358add5\" id=\"u7358add5\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf1f0716f\" id=\"uf1f0716f\">函数（function）是程序非常重要的组成部分，是计算机执行命令的单元；</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u14ae17ac\" id=\"u14ae17ac\"><span data-lake-id=\"udcbfe84d\" id=\"udcbfe84d\">所谓</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u03fbdafb\" id=\"u03fbdafb\">函数</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4dbb43dc\" id=\"u4dbb43dc\">，就是把 具有独立功能的代码块 组织为一个整体，在需要的时候 调用；</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uce2081b1\" id=\"uce2081b1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0171bbdc\" id=\"u0171bbdc\">使用函数可以提高编写的效率以及</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6751d155\" id=\"u6751d155\">代码的重用</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"zsqbF\" id=\"zsqbF\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1450ef1b\" id=\"u1450ef1b\">函数的定义和调用</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ua316fcce\" id=\"ua316fcce\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7dc08541\" id=\"u7dc08541\">函数的使用包含两个步骤:</span></p><ol list=\"u35754109\"><li fid=\"ue82c3207\" data-lake-id=\"u8b12599f\" id=\"u8b12599f\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc94b353d\" id=\"uc94b353d\">定义函数 —— 在函数中编写代码，实现功能</span></li><li fid=\"ue82c3207\" data-lake-id=\"u1cdd0bb0\" id=\"u1cdd0bb0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4da108e2\" id=\"u4da108e2\">调用函数 —— 执行编写的代码</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u0f19aa7b\" id=\"u0f19aa7b\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6e4b42ee\" id=\"u6e4b42ee\">​</span></strong><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"a9wmu\" id=\"a9wmu\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5be0f432\" id=\"u5be0f432\">函数的定义格式</span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22def%20%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%90%8D()%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%B0%81%E8%A3%85%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eqK6o%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u71d95d48\" id=\"u71d95d48\"><code data-lake-id=\"u7d68df19\" id=\"u7d68df19\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc800f1cb\" id=\"uc800f1cb\">def</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ucfd66bcd\" id=\"ucfd66bcd\">是英文</span><code data-lake-id=\"u6dd11536\" id=\"u6dd11536\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1ed5b14f\" id=\"u1ed5b14f\">define</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u5587f493\" id=\"u5587f493\">的缩写；</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9cb013d8\" id=\"u9cb013d8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u76019cc1\" id=\"u76019cc1\">函数名的命名规则和变量的命名规则要保持一致</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"PwD9K\" id=\"PwD9K\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub4c53570\" id=\"ub4c53570\">函数的调用格式</span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%90%8D()%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fyht0%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"NdvRF\" id=\"NdvRF\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"udd0ad9b3\" id=\"udd0ad9b3\">第一个函数</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u9c26c219\" id=\"u9c26c219\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u61c4da6b\" id=\"u61c4da6b\">需求</span></strong></p><blockquote data-lake-id=\"u825ac46a\" id=\"u825ac46a\" class=\"lake-alert lake-alert-info\"><ol list=\"u1d4402d4\"><li fid=\"ud86ad4df\" data-lake-id=\"u776f9388\" id=\"u776f9388\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue8992696\" id=\"ue8992696\">编写一个打招呼 say_hello 的函数，封装三行打招呼的代码</span></li><li fid=\"ud86ad4df\" data-lake-id=\"u4ff37355\" id=\"u4ff37355\"><span data-lake-id=\"u213cfd50\" id=\"u213cfd50\">在函数下方调用打招呼的代码</span></li></ol></blockquote><p data-lake-id=\"u943635e7\" id=\"u943635e7\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u44df2c67\" id=\"u44df2c67\">实现</span></strong></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cndef%20say_hello()%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20print('hello%20world')%5Cn%20%20%20%20print('hello%20world')%5Cn%20%20%20%20print('hello%20world')%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cnsay_hello()%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MBbsv%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"CjqMy\" id=\"CjqMy\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufa3fc53d\" id=\"ufa3fc53d\">函数的文档注释</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u51c7f468\" id=\"u51c7f468\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2383d7b0\" id=\"u2383d7b0\">函数名并不能完全表示出函数的含义，定义函数的时候就需要给函数加上注释。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u98dbacba\" id=\"u98dbacba\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua1e02d1f\" id=\"ua1e02d1f\">函数的注释就是文档注释，以后可以根据此内容查看函数使用说明，或用于生成API文档。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ufd054097\" id=\"ufd054097\"><span data-lake-id=\"u194f276d\" id=\"u194f276d\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u01f2e0eb\" id=\"u01f2e0eb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u804d7d32\" id=\"u804d7d32\">注释的规则和格式如下:</span></p><ul list=\"ub1f52d55\"><li fid=\"u957a9d1e\" data-lake-id=\"u9abcdd17\" id=\"u9abcdd17\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7e8f9fb7\" id=\"u7e8f9fb7\">注释应该定义在</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uecf2e3dd\" id=\"uecf2e3dd\">函数的下方</span></strong></li><li fid=\"u957a9d1e\" data-lake-id=\"ue9e8ad3d\" id=\"ue9e8ad3d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2484cc0a\" id=\"u2484cc0a\">使用三对引号注释</span></li><li fid=\"u957a9d1e\" data-lake-id=\"u1adbb3b8\" id=\"u1adbb3b8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u64ba085d\" id=\"u64ba085d\">调用函数时, 鼠标悬浮在函数名上可以查看函数的说明信息</span></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22def%20say_hello2()%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%E8%BF%99%E6%98%AF%E7%BB%99%E6%9E%97%E9%9D%92%E9%9C%9E%E6%89%93%E6%8B%9B%E5%91%BC%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20print('hello%20%E6%9E%97%E9%9D%92%E9%9C%9E')%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22flO7M%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"sACpa\" id=\"sACpa\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uda58eec0\" id=\"uda58eec0\">函数的参数</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u4600f193\" id=\"u4600f193\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub86eff43\" id=\"ub86eff43\">函数的参数，可以传递数据给函数内部<br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u2dc144e0\" id=\"u2dc144e0\">参数的作用是增加函数的 通用性</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ubef131d1\" id=\"ubef131d1\"><span data-lake-id=\"ueb79fc4e\" id=\"ueb79fc4e\">​</span><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"pEJiV\" id=\"pEJiV\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8cd12218\" id=\"u8cd12218\">参数的定义和调用</span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cndef%20%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%90%8D(%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B01%2C%20%E5%8F%82%E6%9