" id=\"u5009b254\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0231173a\" id=\"u0231173a\">b</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ue08a9289\" id=\"ue08a9289\">属于形参，形参在函数调用的时候才赋值</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"xMpwv\" id=\"xMpwv\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uba17de54\" id=\"uba17de54\">实参</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"uc68ec946\" id=\"uc68ec946\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2ca0d5fb\" id=\"u2ca0d5fb\">全称为</span><code data-lake-id=\"u132fb134\" id=\"u132fb134\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue256a4ce\" id=\"ue256a4ce\">实际参数</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u7853f209\" id=\"u7853f209\">，是在调用时传递给函数的参数</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22sum(10%2C%2020)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nttUu%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uc2d260af\" id=\"uc2d260af\"><span data-lake-id=\"u81f0b0b2\" id=\"u81f0b0b2\">调用</span><code data-lake-id=\"uca6dca5e\" id=\"uca6dca5e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3278c296\" id=\"u3278c296\">sum</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u44fa0d4a\" id=\"u44fa0d4a\">函数时传入的</span><code data-lake-id=\"u2c465480\" id=\"u2c465480\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua2ab8c90\" id=\"ua2ab8c90\">10</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u510486a8\" id=\"u510486a8\">和</span><code data-lake-id=\"u2ba889cf\" id=\"u2ba889cf\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue37b2222\" id=\"ue37b2222\">20</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ubefb60c1\" id=\"ubefb60c1\">即是实参</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"vDNyn\" id=\"vDNyn\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9dfd799b\" id=\"u9dfd799b\">形参作用域</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"uc393d04c\" id=\"uc393d04c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7baff1ce\" id=\"u7baff1ce\">作用域指的是变量的可用范围</span></p><ul list=\"u891eb92a\"><li fid=\"u265119c6\" data-lake-id=\"u2c60f96b\" id=\"u2c60f96b\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf4ba146b\" id=\"uf4ba146b\">形参的作用域只在函数内，超出函数就不能再使用了</span></li><li fid=\"u265119c6\" data-lake-id=\"u52e02c9a\" id=\"u52e02c9a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6c6944ec\" id=\"u6c6944ec\">作用域可以减少不同函数的命名冲突</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id=\"KtZoi\" id=\"KtZoi\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc43dd1c6\" id=\"uc43dd1c6\">局部变量和全局变量</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"PeRLx\" id=\"PeRLx\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uecd3e6a4\" id=\"uecd3e6a4\">局部变量</span></h3><ul list=\"ub9a7ae72\"><li fid=\"u039a8220\" data-lake-id=\"u3cbf689a\" id=\"u3cbf689a\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf9e82ab0\" id=\"uf9e82ab0\">局部变量</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8edbf99f\" id=\"u8edbf99f\">，指的是在</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u05c7f22d\" id=\"u05c7f22d\">函数内部</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u994104e8\" id=\"u994104e8\">定义的变量</span></li><li fid=\"u039a8220\" data-lake-id=\"u08726ef1\" id=\"u08726ef1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4b71d339\" id=\"u4b71d339\">局部变量的目的是</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uce6c3148\" id=\"uce6c3148\">存储需要临时保存的数据</span></strong></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22def%20func1()%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E5%B1%80%E9%83%A8%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%5Cn%20%20%20%20b%20%3D%2020%5Cn%20%20%20%20print('hello%25d'%20%25%20b)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kw0Rt%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ua5eb3426\" id=\"ua5eb3426\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud5d7b5fc\" id=\"ud5d7b5fc\">注意:</span></p><blockquote data-lake-id=\"u76c7162d\" id=\"u76c7162d\" class=\"lake-alert lake-alert-warning\"><ul list=\"ua6874b6f\"><li fid=\"u8abde727\" data-lake-id=\"u6005a25e\" id=\"u6005a25e\"><span data-lake-id=\"udcf58f1f\" id=\"udcf58f1f\">不同的函数，可以定义相同名字的局部变量</span></li><li fid=\"u8abde727\" data-lake-id=\"u7872c257\" id=\"u7872c257\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud972c52d\" id=\"ud972c52d\">局部变量的作用域只在函数内部</span></li></ul></blockquote><h3 data-lake-id=\"dntIZ\" id=\"dntIZ\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue56c3699\" id=\"ue56c3699\">全局变量</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ua66ed695\" id=\"ua66ed695\"><span data-lake-id=\"u67af65e0\" id=\"u67af65e0\">全局变量是在整个py文件中声明，全局范围内都可以访问</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E5%85%A8%E5%B1%80%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%5Cnm%20%3D%2010%5Cnn%20%3D%2020%5Cn%5Cndef%20func()%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%86%85%E8%AE%BF%E9%97%AE%E5%85%A8%E5%B1%80%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%5Cn%20%20%20%20print(m)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WZJC6%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"iLJzM\" id=\"iLJzM\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc03aedae\" id=\"uc03aedae\">函数内修改全局变量</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ubcdfdf81\" id=\"ubcdfdf81\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub776333f\" id=\"ub776333f\">如果要在函数内部修改全局变量 需要首先使用</span><span data-lake-id=\"u70fd640b\" id=\"u70fd640b\">global</span><span data-lake-id=\"u9bdfcc61\" id=\"u9bdfcc61\">关键字将声明全局变量</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E5%85%A8%E5%B1%80%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%5Cnm%20%3D%2010%5Cn%5Cndef%20func()%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8global%E5%A3%B0%E6%98%8E%E5%85%A8%E5%B1%80%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%5Cn%20%20%20%20global%20m%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E5%B0%86m%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E6%88%9020%5Cn%20%20%20%20m%20%3D%2030%5Cn%20%20%20%20print(%5C%22%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%86%85%E9%83%A8%20m%3D%5C%22%2C%20m)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FZLXQ%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card>",
